lisa-design:
Callers are copied verbatim from the reviewed batch-1 references (plugin-file-attestation#9, mock-plugin-1, mock-plugin-policies-1 cut-prerelease), pinned to workflows v1.5.2 (6e7fc9c). release-please.yml's concurrency group deliberately has no cancel-in-progress (a release-please run must not be cancelled mid-release); release.yml has none because each release event is unique. Seed 0.1.0 = releases/latest v0.1.0, a final tag whose commit is an ancestor of main; no bootstrap-sha. protocol-version "2" is correct: W2 (#12) added Init; v0.1.0 had no protocol annotation, so the next release changes what agents without protocol_version config do (they read the annotation and run it as v2).
